  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "風颱"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>殷&nbsp; &nbsp; 雷</b></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">提一張全是小鬼仔殼ê符紙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā後日仔ê笑聲、燒lō、bâ霧光</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Jio̍k做一丸phè--起-來（手底沉--lueh）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Koh頓兩蕊血紅ê卜字型目睭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">倒kuì我ê喉鐘頂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一隻無khînn無khi̍p ê落雨尪仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kōo伊kiōng-beh盡磅ê khuì力</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Huah喙ta</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雷ê聲sueh是你ê報頭　聽講你是</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">山kah海以外ê第三勢力</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">（風kah雨kah雲kah霧全se̍h你leh行）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你是賜福ê天使</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">路樹徛黃　伸手beh giú你風mua ê áu-pôo</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">千萬支喙uì âm溝底出世leh kā你褒嗦</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規座城市是一句tīng-tauh ê禱詞——</span></p></div></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">請你用全部ê愛來疼惜--阮</span></p></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮是一蕊koh一蕊</span></p></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">含含（hâm-hâm）ê蓮</span></p></div></div></blockquote><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">終其尾你來--ah　tshuā領天兵天將34 sian</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">向山海發動革命　咒死tse̍h誓</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh消除所有tsìnn風ê意象</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你suah封家己做皇　對天地大聲huah-hiu</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā等待--你ê攑kuân ê手一肢一肢áu-tsi̍h</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">That倒街ê落葉是你放肆（hòng-sù）ê唚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">仇恨bi̍t過規粒島嶼</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">重重疊疊ê眼牆nǹg--過tsiah看破</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你hit粒無魂ê目睭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">佗一个隱喻ē khah鬥搭？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">從來to m̄知方向ê干樂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Iah是tng-leh墮落ê竹田嬰？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">青磅白磅　斬斷我tsit雙虔誠ê掌</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">早就破碎ê夢siânn一siū有分張ê烏狗蟻kā圍tī中ng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsiânn做死亡ê捲螺仔tsn̄g一輾一輾</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">趁神話iáu未完全散--去以前</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來替家己辦一場</span></p></div></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tshia-iānn ê喪禮</span></p></div></div></blockquote><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiVHJFAv_kf_II2ClN3J7v05GfaXlmxiEKif0H-D2ZN-6sZ_B09Ube465tJtAC2SlwFEpmcqQsv77sqZihIQYmPRsQJjBAQcFwG7fGIUz5mCTsZ_3SYaBNMnPCLMolAXvWNsfnxwoSZ8t3v4GQNjRQ1iaOen2HqHxcP3Adl0ZLxzSiKZs1E-1ch4Q52IRjX/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiVHJFAv_kf_II2ClN3J7v05GfaXlmxiEKif0H-D2ZN-6sZ_B09Ube465tJtAC2SlwFEpmcqQsv77sqZihIQYmPRsQJjBAQcFwG7fGIUz5mCTsZ_3SYaBNMnPCLMolAXvWNsfnxwoSZ8t3v4GQNjRQ1iaOen2HqHxcP3Adl0ZLxzSiKZs1E-1ch4Q52IRjX/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"c